.env*
!.env*.example

# Google OAuth client secret JSON (downloaded from Google Cloud Console for
# P0-A.2's OAuth client setup) — a real credential, same sensitivity class
# as the Supabase service-role key. Was sitting untracked but NOT gitignored
# for this entire session (confirmed via `git check-ignore`, exit 1) — one
# `git add -A` away from being committed and, if ever pushed, exposed. Found
# during the 2026-08-08 adversarial business review of plan.md.
client_secret_*.json

# Account recovery / 2FA backup codes (found untracked at repo root while
# setting up the remote, 2026-08-10) — same class of secret as the OAuth
# client file above, must never enter history.
recovery-codes.txt

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
